@startuml
title RNF8 — Privacidade e conformidade com a LGPD · Máquina de estados: UserAccount.status × pedidos LGPD
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
ACTIVE : consentimentos vigentes
ACTIVE : dados cifrados
state "Exportação pendente" as ExportPendente
ExportPendente : DataExportJob agendado
state "Exportação pronta" as ExportPronta
ExportPronta : JSON + CSV no S3
ExportPronta : link de 24 h
state "PENDING_DELETION" as PENDING_DELETION
PENDING_DELETION : 7 dias de arrependimento
PENDING_DELETION : sessões revogadas
state "DELETED (anonimizada)" as DELETED
DELETED : trilhas preservadas
[*] --> ACTIVE
ACTIVE --> ExportPendente : POST /me/export
ExportPendente --> ExportPronta : job concluído
ExportPronta --> ACTIVE : link expira
ACTIVE --> PENDING_DELETION : DELETE /me + senha
PENDING_DELETION --> ACTIVE : cancela no prazo
PENDING_DELETION --> DELETED : carência vencida
DELETED --> [*]
@enduml
